./redteam/reports/stage_194.md:49:| Retarded module expands to even form + `i\chi_Q\omega^5` | II: `Yret series - expected low-frequency form` | match |
./redteam/reports/stage_194.md:50:| `\chi_Q=1` fixing | II: `retarded module matches ... when chi_Q=1` and `odd-coefficient matching fixes chi_Q-1` | match |
