./redteam/reports/stage_197.md:47:| (3) `Delta_branch=0 ⟺ chi_Q=1 ⟺ N_Q=1 ⟺ Delta_Q=0` | Sec IV check-3 (`chi_Q=1+Delta_Q` reparametrization) + `Delta_norm_bad` anti-vacuity guard at `chi_Q=6/5` | match (genuine) |
