 succeeded in 0ms:
     1	\section[Stage 047]{Stage 047: Coherent-Kernel Dimensionless Map and Support-Enhancement Factor}
     2	\label{stage:047}
     3	
     4	\stagefield{Part / anchor}{Part III; primary anchor \resultanchor{MTDC-T6}.}
     5	\claimstatus{\StatusExactClosure{} for the coherent tracking map.}
     6	\stagefield{Purpose}{Stage~047 introduces the coherent support ratio \(\zeta\) and shows that it changes the available loading but not the selected target ratio.}
     7	\stagefield{Inputs}{The coherent tracking branch, dimensionless split--\(U\) variables, and a support lane parallel to the tracked mixed direction.}
     8	
     9	\stagefield{Verification}{SymPy audit: \StageFile{scripts/moving_throat_pde_stage047_coherent_kernel_map_sympy_audit.py}; transcript: \StageFile{scripts/output/moving_throat_pde_stage047_coherent_kernel_map_sympy_audit.txt}.  Mathematica audit: \StageFile{mathematica/moving_throat_pde_stage047_coherent_kernel_map_mathematica_audit.wl}; transcript: \StageFile{mathematica/output/moving_throat_pde_stage047_coherent_kernel_map_mathematica_audit.txt}.}
    10	
    11	\subsection*{Derivation}
    12	
    13	The total tracking load factors as
    14	\begin{equation}
    15	\label{eq:app-stage047-Mtr}
    16	M_{\rm tr}=M_{\rm mix}S(\zeta;\epsilon),
    17	\end{equation}
    18	where
    19	\begin{equation}
    20	\label{eq:app-stage047-S}
    21	\boxed{
    22	S(\zeta;\epsilon)=1+\frac{\zeta(1-\epsilon)}{1-\epsilon\zeta}}.
    23	\end{equation}
    24	The coherent target ratio is
    25	\begin{equation}
    26	\label{eq:app-stage047-Rtarget}
    27	\boxed{
    28	R_{\rm target}=\frac{\Lambda(1-\epsilon_\eta)(1-\epsilon)^2}{Z_W(1+\chi_0)^2}}.
    29	\end{equation}
    30	It contains no \(\zeta\).  Therefore the support lane only supplies loading; it does not move the target locus itself.
    31	
    32	\stagefield{Output}{Support enhancement factor \eqref{eq:app-stage047-S} and target independence \eqref{eq:app-stage047-Rtarget}.}
    33	\stagefield{Downstream use}{Stage~048 inverts \(S\) to obtain \(\zeta_{\rm req}\); Stages~049--050 compute whether physical D/N support can supply it.}
    34	

