notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage197_conditional_packetA_closure_theorem.md:1:# Moving-Throat PDE — Stage 197: Exact Conditional Packet-A Closure Theorem, the Equivalence `\Delta_{\rm branch}=0 \iff \chi_Q=1`, and the Final Retarded Finish-Line Reduction
