     9	       extension and the tauQ-derivative gate; this stage's series truncates
    10	       at omega^5 by design.
    11	  (iii) "outgoing l=2 DtN fingerprint against the normalized z=omega a/c_s
    12	       expansion" — the chi_Q = 1 identification by DtN comparison lives at
    13	       stage 097 (single_normalization_defect); this stage carries chi_Q as
    14	       a free real symbol.
    15	This stage owns Check (i) — the `mhat_0^2 chi_Q N_Q = 1` closure — which is
    16	derived below by imposing the observable-side condition `mhat_0^2 * Gamma_5 =
    17	Gamma_5_target` on the script-derived Gamma_5(K_0, chi_Q, Omega).
    18	"""
